{"title": "Stealthy", "pageid": 28181, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Stealthy", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Stealthy</b> is a passive feature that improves the wielders ability to sneak around undetected.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Gain a +1 bonus to <a href=\"/wiki/Stealth\" title=\"Stealth\">Stealth Checks</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Leather_Armour_%2B1\" title=\"Leather Armour +1\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d2/Leather_Armour_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Leather_Armour_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d2/Leather_Armour_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Leather_Armour_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d2/Leather_Armour_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Leather_Armour_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d2/Leather_Armour_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Leather_Armour_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d2/Leather_Armour_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Leather_Armour_%2B1\" title=\"Leather Armour +1\">Leather Armour +1</a></span></li><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"g